{%- set src_rel = record.source_path.relative_to(root) -%}
{%- set display_name = record.title or record.slug -%}
{%- set short_desc = (record.description or '')|replace('\n', ' ')|trim -%}
{%- if short_desc|length > 200 -%}
{%- set short_desc = short_desc[:197] ~ '...' -%}
{%- endif -%}
---
name: {{ display_name }}
{%- if short_desc %}
description: {{ short_desc }}
{%- endif %}
{%- if record.model %}
model: {{ record.model }}
{%- endif %}
tools:
{%- if record.skills %}
{%- for skill in record.skills %}
  - skill: {{ prefix }}{{ skill }}
{%- endfor %}
{%- else %}
  # No specific skills declared
{%- endif %}
---

{% if record.body|trim %}{{ record.body|trim }}

{% endif -%}
## Agent Details

- **Slug:** {{ record.slug }}
{%- if record.jurisdiction.read or record.jurisdiction.write %}
- **Jurisdiction (read):** {{ record.jurisdiction.read | join(', ') if record.jurisdiction.read else '(unscoped)' }}
- **Jurisdiction (write):** {{ record.jurisdiction.write | join(', ') if record.jurisdiction.write else '(unscoped)' }}
{%- endif %}
{%- if record.autonomous %}
- **Autonomous:** {{ record.autonomous | join(', ') }}
{%- endif %}
{%- if record.escalates %}
- **Escalates:** {{ record.escalates | join(', ') }}
{%- endif %}
{%- if record.skills %}
- **Skills:** {{ record.skills | join(', ') }}
{%- endif %}

Source: [`{{ src_rel }}`]({{ src_rel }}) — the substrate is the source of truth.
